    <div class="about-text">
      <p class="lead">Hi, I'm {{ site.name }}, a photographer.</p>
      <p>What I love most about photography is how much emotion a single picture can hold when it's taken at just the right moment: a laugh, a quiet glance, a dog mid-grin, the sky going dark at totality. I photograph animals, the people I love, and the moments in between, always waiting for that instant when a feeling shows itself. I hope a few of these make you smile.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>The best way to reach me is by email: <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
      {%- if site.social.length %}
      <p>You can also find me on:</p>
      <ul>
        {%- for link in site.social %}
        <li><a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.label }}</a></li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
